# Valid recipients of the sink: <local>@<domain>.test with a conservative character set.
# (virtual(8) forbids regexp substitution, so the Maildir path is built by sink-deliver from the
# pipe(8) ${domain} and ${user} macros instead; this table only decides who exists.)
/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._+=-]{0,63}@([a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?\.)+test$/	OK
